{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42105","headline":"将去广陵别史员外南斋 · 徐铉","name":"将去广陵别史员外南斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家声曾与金张辈，官署今居何宋间。\n起得高斋临静曲，种成奇树学他山。\n鸳鸾终日同醒醉，萝薜常时共往还。\n贱子今朝独南去，不堪回首望清闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}